cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "aNCA: A Dynamic Shiny App to perform NCA"
abstract: >-
  An interactive Shiny application for performing non-compartmental
  analysis (NCA) on pre-clinical and clinical pharmacokinetic data,
  building on the PKNCA package for core estimators and providing
  interactive visualizations and CDISC outputs.
type: software
